Output demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "ai-cli ollama 'What is Go in 2 sentences?'"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "ai-cli ollama -p code 'Write a fibonacci function in Go'"
Enter
Sleep 8s

Type "ai-cli ollama -i"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "Tell me a joke about programming"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "exit"
Enter
Sleep 1s
